  "description": "When Princess Nova’s beloved knight, Eric, is tasked with the impossible mission of capturing a legendary wolf on her behalf, Nova decides to reverse their roles— she’ll catch the wolf for him instead! But when Nova pursues the wolf, she discovers that he’s actually the beautiful but cursed Prince Aron of the Northern Kingdom, doomed to search endlessly for the one knight who can break his spell. If Nova herself is Aron’s knight (gasp!), can she break his curse and return to Eric in one piece?\nSource: Tapas\nIncludes 1 extra chapter.",
